\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30001486 (OWR-4338-002). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Geometry, Quantum Fields, and Strings: Categorial Aspects (2010), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2010/25, pp. 1485--1533; official report source and mathematical context.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2010/25}.
\item[S3] Official EMS Press PDF of the same Oberwolfach report; PDF pages 29--30.
\url{https://ems.press/content/serial-article-files/46283}.
\item[S4] Toledano-Laredo; reference in the saved dated catalogue literature review.
\url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1003.2017}.
\item[S5] Gautam--Toledano-Laredo; reference in the saved dated catalogue literature review.
